    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d805">

                <pb facs="0665" n="549" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg549"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/23490.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Special
                        Commissioners.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 1, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>As the minutes expressly state that the agreements covered by the protocols are
                    conditional upon the establishment of a provisional <pb facs="0666" n="550"
                        xml:id="pg550"/> government in Mexico acceptably to the contending factions,
                    the President directs you to sign the minutes stipulating in so doing that—
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>In signing these minutes the representatives of the President of the
                            United States feel it to be their duty to declare that they do so with
                            the express understanding that nothing contained herein is to be
                            construed as a recognition of the government of General Huerta by the
                            Government of the United States.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
